# Score viewer

- Load Verovio only in Client Components via `ScoreViewerLoader` (`next/dynamic` + `ssr: false`).
- Prefer `verovio/wasm` + `VerovioToolkit`: `loadZipDataBuffer` / `loadData` → `renderToSVG` per page.
- v1 pagination uses Previous/Next controls; do not SSR giant SVGs or import WASM on catalog list pages.
- Fetch score bytes from `GET /api/scores/{id}/file`; pass `compressed` from `r2Key.endsWith(".mxl")` and/or ZIP magic — do not rely on the API URL suffix.
- `default_visible_parts` is stored for later; v1 renders all staves (no Verovio `partNames` option).
- v1 uses Verovio default glyphs; SMuFL webfont on the viewer route is optional later.
- Accessibility: real HTML title/composer; `aria` on the wrapper — SVG is not music for screen readers.
- OSMD is fallback only if WASM bundling fails; do not switch without updating `docs/decisions.md`.
